OL,3,ASingapore launches matchmaking service
OL,4,Afor government workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSingapore has rolled out a matchmaking
OL,7,Fservice for its government workers, an
OL,8,Finitiative that comes as the country
OL,9,Fwrestles with a record-low fertility
OL,10,Frate.
OL,12,FFirstDate, which launched this week for
OL,13,Fthose aged 21 to 35, boasts "a
OL,14,Fdifferent approach to dating", where it
OL,15,Fuses a Nobel-winning algorithm to match
OL,16,Fparticipants to one date at a time.
OL,17,F"Swipe fatigue ends here," its website
OL,18,Freads.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
