OL,3,ASingapore launches matchmaking service
OL,4,Afor government workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FParticipants sign in using the national
OL,7,Fdigital identity system and answer a
OL,8,Fsurvey about their interests, habits
OL,9,Fand values.
OL,11,FFirstDate's launch drew mixed responses
OL,12,Famong Singaporeans, with some
OL,13,Fdescribing it as "dystopian" and others
OL,14,Fsaying they would be keen to give it a
OL,15,Fshot.
